WEBVTT

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:44.980
Yes?

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:47.760
Just a minute, please!

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:51.030
Yes!

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:54.170
Who is it?

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:02.460
Kyoko.

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:06.970
Dear, Kyoko's here
to see you.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:08.620
Kyoko?

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:14.090
Kyoko!

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:17.720
Are you okay, Dad?

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:24.460
I'm so glad you're here.
I feel better already.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:30.270
I think my fever is gone.

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:49.530
And so what's been happening?

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:50.560
About what?

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:52.990
You know, what's going on

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:54.560
between you and Godai
at Maison Ikkoku?

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:04.530
Kyoko!

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:10.740
You're not involved with.
What's his name?

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:14.620
It's Godai, dear.

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:21.020
Are you dating him?

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:22.550
well...

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.490
I guess you'd
find out anyway.

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:32.720
- I don't approve!
- I knew it!

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:35.000
I was right, after all!

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.560
And have you decided
to remarry?

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:44.340
Yes, though he hasn't
actually proposed yet.

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:53.090
No! Never!
I won't allow it!

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:03.630
I'm pooped!

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:06.620
I've just about had it.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:11.310
I know I tried to
talk you into this job,

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:14.340
but it doesn't pay well
did you know that?

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:18.500
Don't say that to someone
who just got hired.

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:21.350
We can't have him quit now.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:23.540
I want to get married
and quit this job!

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:27.350
I envy you.
You're getting married.

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.120
I have to keep
working for a while.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:33.580
How did he propose?

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:35.510
How?

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:38.930
We've been together
for so long.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.190
He just said
it's about time.

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:44.390
So I said okay.

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:45.450
Where?

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:47.800
At a noodle shop.

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:51.500
That's it?!
How unromantic.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:52.610
I know.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:56.270
I thought it would have been
a little more romantic than that.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.350
But the point is,
you're getting married.

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:07.120
Godai? Are you interested?

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:08.920
Huh? Yes?

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:11.690
Are you thinking
about getting married?

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:13.690
K-Kind of.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.630
You have a girlfriend?

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:17.600
She came here looking
for you before, right?

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.730
Oh... well...

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:23.410
I want to propose
to her soon,

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.440
but I can't get
the timing right.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.420
And I can't think of
anything romantic to say.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.940
I suppose I shouldn't
keep her waiting too long.

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:37.850
Maybe I'll p-p-propose tonight.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:39.010
Time to get back to work.

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:44.060
Wash the tea cups,
won't you?

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:59.180
He hasn't even tried to see
how I feel about this.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:03.420
No matter how much
dad opposes, I'm going to..

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:08.250
But.

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:12.290
when is Godai
going to propose to me?

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:23.120
Please marry me.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:25.740
That's too unoriginal.

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:28.240
What's something
a little more creative

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:29.810
that'll roll off my tongue?

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:35.410
Kyoko, let's get buried
in the same grave.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:40.350
What am I thinking?!
Bad omens!

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:44.360
Please become Kyoko Godai.

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:46.490
That makes me blush!

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:03.630
Miso soup...?

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:09.100
Please make miso soup
just for me!

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:12.910
...Yes!

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:14.200
That's it!

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.020
Hi Godai.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:26.730
May I talk to you?

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:28.600
Sure.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:39.830
Um..

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:40.510
Yes?

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:55.080
K-Kyoko?

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:56.620
Yes?

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:02.830
W-Will you make misa sup?

00:08:09.490 --> 00:08:10.680
Relax. Relax...

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.200
What was that?

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:18.380
Err...nothing.

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:31.570
I thought he came
to propose to me.

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:40.900
Would you like
some more tea?

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:44.660
I want...

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:47.270
I want miso soup.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.410
- Kyoko!
- Yes?

00:08:53.920 --> 00:09:01.490
I-I'd love to have.
your homemade miso soup.

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:08.210
Yes.

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:19.170
I'm so glad I saved some
for Soichiro's breakfast.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:23.620
Would you like
some rice, too?

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:26.820
No thanks. Just miso soup
would be great.

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:33.880
It's delicious.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:35.330
I'm glad!

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:40.760
I Forgot.
Kyoko can be dense.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:44.740
She won't get it if I ask her
in a roundabout way.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:48.470
I have to be direct and say,
"Please marry me."

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:55.210
K-Kyoko, will you...

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:56.950
Yes?

00:09:58.460 --> 00:09:59.110
Will you...

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:00.870
Let's party!

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:05.480
Godai? What are you
doing here?

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:08.090
You think a bowl
of miso soup

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:11.230
will get you through
a cold night like this?

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:21.610
Stupid Godai.

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.100
You're such a procrastinator.

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:26.350
Manager!

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:28.630
Manager!

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:30.170
Yes?

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:32.320
Your phone's been ringing.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:34.040
Thank you!

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:41.190
What? Dad?

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:46.250
He sneaked out.
He's still got a fever.

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:51.030
If he shows up at your place,
you know what to do.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.290
If he comes here, I'll
take him back right away.

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:57.440
Okay. Bye.

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:00.970
Something wrong
with your dad?

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:02.690
No.

00:11:04.150 --> 00:11:05.490
I wonder what he's up to?

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.720
I wonder if he's coming
to oppose our marriage?

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:11.820
Hurry up!

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:16.000
Who's that?

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:25.500
I won't let him marry her!

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:31.480
I'll tell him that myself!

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.590
Your father is missing? And?

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:46.050
He'd been in bed
with a bad cold.

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:49.460
And.

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:54.420
He may be on his
way to see you.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:59.030
I told him yesterday.

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:02.240
about our relationship.

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:03.940
I see.

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:10.950
If I see him here,
I'll contact you right away.

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:28.500
I know that if her father
comes here..

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:33.370
it must be to
oppose our marriage.

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:51.020
I told you! I'm not some pervert!

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:55.420
Then why were you
standing there?

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:05.290
Daddy! Carry me
on your back!

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:06.740
On my back? Sure.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:12.980
Daddy, your back
is so warm.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:17.270
Yeah?
You're warm, too, Yui

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:19.810
So you're not cold,
are you, Daddy?

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:20.590
No, I'm not.

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:27.760
Daddy, carry me on your back!

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:33.400
When you're a big girl,

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.770
will you carry me
on your back?

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:41.880
No! You're too heavy.
I'll be crushed.

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:47.250
Then your husband will
have to carry me on his back.

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:51.890
No! I'm not going
to get married.

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:54.490
I see.

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:00.400
Kyoko.

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:14.460
Your father didn't
show up here, after all

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:18.990
But if I see him,
I'll definitely call you.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.800
Something happened
to your father, didn't it?

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:26.840
Yes.

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:29.520
This is for you, Yuka.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:32.600
Thank you, Chief!

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:36.840
I have a panda bear
for you, Kiyoko.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:45.740
Look! Chief gave me this!

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:50.150
You made that?
You're pretty good.

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:55.120
Oh, it's just a little something.

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:56.600
A parting gift?

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:57.490
Yes.

00:14:58.550 --> 00:14:59.810
What's "parting"?

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:02.900
Nothing you need to know.

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:09.900
Oh, yeah.
There's a visitor...for you.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:13.270
Come on in.

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:20.020
Mr. Chigusa?

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:32.620
So what do you plan
to do with my daughter?

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:37.990
Well?

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:41.400
Actually.

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:45.350
I was planning
to come and see you

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:47.790
after I proposed to Kyoko.

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:52.110
But I want to marr-

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:55.880
Stop! I can't allow Kyoko
to become unhappy!

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:59.460
I promise you
I'll make her happy!

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.560
Don't make promises
you can't keep!

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:07.390
Marriage will not
make her happy!

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:08.990
Mr. Chigusa?!

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:11.440
That'll be all!
I'm leaving!

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:14.950
Mr. Chigusa?

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:26.820
Her old man...
Who knew he'd go this far.

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:31.150
I don't think Godai will
ever get together with Manager.

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:34.980
Spring won't be knocking
at Godai's door.

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:40.670
Dad, why are you doing this?

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:49.640
Kyoko..

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:53.180
what am I
supposed to do for you

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:54.450
In a situation like this?

00:16:56.650 --> 00:17:00.510
If only I knew this would
happen, I should never have...

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:04.490
I should never have
let you get married!

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:08.300
I'm not going
to get married!

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:10.000
I'm not.

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:11.650
I'm not.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:21.430
Kyoko!!!

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:27.110
What're you doing here?

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:28.580
Me?

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:32.370
Sir, you're up!

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:38.150
On behalf of everyone here.

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:40.190
Thank you for all your work!

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:42.560
Thank you!!

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:44.360
Thanks.

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:48.100
Chief, you're welcome
back any time.

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:52.570
Don't say that! We have
to give him a proper send-off.

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:56.310
Sir, why don't you
let up a little?

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.320
O-Okay.

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:07.120
A-Are you all right?

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.140
Leave me alone!

00:18:10.630 --> 00:18:11.260
Chief?

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:17.070
Chief, is it true that
you're not coming back?

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:19.960
Don't go!

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:23.300
Don't give him
a hard time, kids.

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.130
No!!

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:42.680
Don't cry, sir.
It's a new beginning for Chief.

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:47.060
Cheer up!
It's a happy occasion!

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:56.460
That's no concern of mine!

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:01.580
I don't want to see
Kyoko cry ever again!

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:03.340
No more.

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:10.450
Dad...

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:14.100
Kyoko!

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.230
Dad...

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:26.650
What are you talking about?
Why would I cry?

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:33.850
You're so silly.

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:58.690
I'm sorry. I'll get a cab.

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:01.280
It's all right.
We're not very far.

00:20:01.350 --> 00:20:02.630
I'll carry him
on my back.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.010
My father's such
a troublemaker.

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:18.910
Did he say something
rude to you?

00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:20.910
No.

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:25.420
Your father is worried.

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:30.060
To him, you'll always be.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:35.890
his little girl

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:43.200
His little Kyoko.

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:49.410
But.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:53.940
to me.

00:20:56.240 --> 00:21:00.420
you're the only woman in my life.

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:09.130
Please marry me.

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:56.980
I won't ever make you cry.

00:21:58.890 --> 00:22:00.290
Please be mine..

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:03.830
for the rest of your life.

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:13.500
Can you make me...one promise?

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:15.920
Yes.

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:19.370
Please.

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:23.340
Even if it's just by one day.

00:22:26.850 --> 00:22:30.110
Please live longer than me.

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:39.730
I don't think...  I can...  Live alone...

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:43.300
ever again.

00:22:46.980 --> 00:22:47.690
Kyoko.

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:55.010
I promise you'll
never be alone.

00:22:57.520 --> 00:22:58.630
You better be right.

00:22:59.060 --> 00:22:59.820
Dad...?

00:23:00.730 --> 00:23:03.520
If you ever get
sick of this guy,

00:23:03.600 --> 00:23:06.260
you can come home
any time.

00:23:12.860 --> 00:23:15.530
Thank you, Dad.

00:23:49.270 --> 00:23:51.730
You're going to your
home in Niigata?

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:55.460
Do you think Godai's parents
will give them their blessing?

00:23:55.710 --> 00:23:58.500
She's an older woman,
and it's her second time.

00:23:58.590 --> 00:24:00.540
I'm sure they'll love Kyoko.

00:24:00.650 --> 00:24:04.170
Next: How Touching!
A Ring Filled with Grandma's Love!

00:24:04.890 --> 00:24:06.540
Thank you, Grandma.
